# Default endpoint address for local testing
@authority=http://localhost:7071

### Prompt the coordinator agent
POST {{authority}}/api/agents/coordinator/run
Content-Type: text/plain

Compare the pros and cons of microservices vs monolithic architecture.

### Prompt with JSON body and thread ID for multi-turn conversation
POST {{authority}}/api/agents/coordinator/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Now summarize the key takeaways from your analysis.",
  "thread_id": "my-session-1"
}

### Prompt the researcher agent directly (bypassing the coordinator)
POST {{authority}}/api/agents/researcher/run
Content-Type: text/plain

Provide a detailed analysis of event-driven architecture patterns.
